        <h2 class="section-title">Introduction</h2>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <p>Much of the food consumed each year is preserved by packaging it in hermetically-sealed containers in a process known as canning.</p>
            <p>One of the most important steps in the canning of foods is 'thermal processing'; more commonly referred to as the retorting operation.</p>
            <p>In this operation, strict specifications concerning both time and temperature must be adhered to and repeated, batch after batch, to obtain sterile product of uniform quality.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
